            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Welcome to chemistry class! Today, we are going to tackle one of the most important concepts in science: **Redox Reactions**. ",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 126
          },
          {
            "id": "p2",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Have you ever wondered why a sliced apple turns brown, how your smartphone battery holds a charge, or why an old bicycle gets rusty? ",
            "start": 128,
            "end": 261
          },
          {
            "id": "p3",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "The answer to all three is the exact same thing: **a redox reaction**.",
            "start": 263,
            "end": 333
          },
          {
            "id": "p4",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Let’s break it down so it makes complete sense.",
            "start": 335,
            "end": 382
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "separator"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "---",
            "start": 384,
            "end": 387
          },
          {
            "id": "p6",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
