            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 2. The Golden Mnemonic: OIL RIG",
            "start": 862,
            "end": 897
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "In high school chemistry, the easiest way to remember what is happening to the electrons is a simple phrase:",
            "start": 899,
            "end": 1007
          },
          {
            "id": "p15",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "mnemonic"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "> **OIL RIG**",
            "start": 1009,
            "end": 1022
          },
          {
            "id": "p16",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "mnemonic"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "> *   **O**xidation **I**s **L**oss (of electrons)",
            "start": 1023,
            "end": 1073
          },
          {
            "id": "p17",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "mnemonic"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "> *   **R**eduction **I**s **G**ain (of electrons)",
            "start": 1074,
            "end": 1124
          },
          {
            "id": "p18",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "mnemonic"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "*(Another popular one you might hear is: **LEO** the lion says **GER** — **L**ose **E**lectrons **O**xidation / **G**ain **E**lectrons **R**eduction).*",
            "start": 1126,
            "end": 1277
          },
