            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 5. The \"Secret Agent\" Trap (Watch Out for This on Tests!)",
            "start": 2351,
            "end": 2412
          },
          {
            "id": "p37",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Teachers love to put this on exams because it trips people up. You will often be asked to identify the **Oxidizing Agent** and the **Reducing Agent**.",
            "start": 2414,
            "end": 2564
          },
          {
            "id": "p38",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Think of an \"agent\" like a travel agent: A travel agent doesn’t go on vacation; they *help you* go on vacation.",
            "start": 2566,
            "end": 2677
          },
          {
            "id": "p39",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "*   **The Oxidizing Agent:** Causes the *other* guy to be oxidized. (How? By taking its electrons! Therefore, the oxidizing agent gets **reduced**).",
            "start": 2678,
            "end": 2826
          },
          {
            "id": "p40",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "*   **The Reducing Agent:** Causes the *other* guy to be reduced. (How? By giving it electrons! Therefore, the reducing agent gets **oxidized**).",
            "start": 2827,
            "end": 2972
          },
          {
            "id": "p41",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
